<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<task id="031" project="reuse-governance-tightening-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Execute the owner-approved decision for @spaarke/ai-context</title>
    <phase>4 Package reviews</phase>
    <gate>blocked until 030 approved</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies .ts/.tsx code in src/client/shared and src/solutions/SpaarkeAi, and tests</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Single-consumer package move with a written migration outline from task 030</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>touches .claude/ (ADR-012 census) and shares src/solutions/SpaarkeAi/package.json with 032 and 033</parallel-reason>
    <deps>030</deps>
    <tags>typescript, refactoring, migration, testing</tags>
    <estimated-effort>2-4 hours</estimated-effort>
  </metadata>

  <prompt>Carry out the decision recorded for @spaarke/ai-context in notes/package-reviews.md (sanction, consolidate or retire), keeping the ADR-012 census table and SharedPackageCensusTests in agreement in the same change.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in the shared TypeScript packages, Vite code pages and the ADR-012 census.</role>
  <goal>The ai-context action is complete, the SpaarkeAi build and tests pass, and SharedPackageCensusTests passes with the updated census.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>spec.md FR-09. Consumer (verified 2026-11-10): src/solutions/SpaarkeAi/package.json line 40. Retire means fold the source into its consumer and delete the package; consolidate means move it into the named sanctioned package; sanction means an ADR-012 amendment (Path B).</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.AI.Context</file>
      <file role="modify">src/solutions/SpaarkeAi/package.json</file>
      <file role="modify">src/solutions/SpaarkeAi/vite.config.ts</file>
      <file role="modify">.claude/adr/ADR-012-shared-components.md</file>
      <file role="modify">tests/Spaarke.ArchTests/SharedPackageCensusTests.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">projects/reuse-governance-tightening-r1/notes/package-reviews.md</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="030" status="pending">Owner-approved decision and migration outline</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-012">The census row and the SharedPackageCensusTests entry change in the same commit as the package change; a sanction adds an ADR-012 amendment naming the package and its contract outside the census table.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-012">Code moved into a sanctioned shared package keeps its tests, uses no ComponentFramework.* or direct Xrm.WebApi, and exports its types.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-022">If code moves into @spaarke/ui-components, it uses no React 18/19-only APIs (useTransition, useDeferredValue).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">Tests move with the code; cover the moved behaviour's existing contract. Anything beyond that needs a one-line justification in task notes.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Run conflict-check before editing src/solutions/SpaarkeAi (hot path, 12 active projects). Install with npm install --legacy-peer-deps --no-audit --no-fund (not npm ci).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Do not touch any other grandfathered package in this task.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <files>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-012-shared-components.md</file>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-022-pcf-platform-libraries.md</file>
      <file>docs/adr/ADR-038-testing-strategy.md</file>
      <file>.claude/constraints/testing.md</file>
      <file>.claude/patterns/testing/unit-test-structure.md</file>
      <file>.claude/patterns/testing/mocking-patterns.md</file>
      <file>.claude/skills/conflict-check/SKILL.md</file>
      <file>projects/reuse-governance-tightening-r1/notes/package-reviews.md</file>
    </files>
    <patterns>
      <pattern name="Census in one PR" location="tests/Spaarke.ArchTests/SharedPackageCensusTests.cs">Folder list, ADR table and test agree.</pattern>
    </patterns>
  </knowledge>

  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Read the ai-context section and owner decision; run conflict-check for SpaarkeAi.</step>
    <step order="2">Apply the decision (move or amend), updating imports, package.json, vite/tsconfig aliases and build config in the consumer.</step>
    <step order="3">Update the ADR-012 census row and SharedPackageCensusTests in the same change.</step>
    <step order="4">Build SpaarkeAi (npm run build) and run its tests; run dotnet test on tests/Spaarke.ArchTests filtered to SharedPackageCensus.</step>
    <step order="5">Update TASK-INDEX.md: change this task's status cell to `✅ [done]`.</step>
    <step order="6">Record deviations and any defects found in projects/reuse-governance-tightening-r1/notes/.</step>
  </steps>

  <escalation>
    <trigger>If the move requires changing another package's public API or touches a second consumer not listed in task 030, STOP and escalate.</trigger>
  </escalation>

  <tools>
    <tool name="npm">npm install --legacy-peer-deps --no-audit --no-fund; npm run build; npm test</tool>
    <tool name="dotnet">dotnet test tests/Spaarke.ArchTests --filter SharedPackageCensus</tool>
  </tools>

  <outputs>
    <output type="code">src/solutions/SpaarkeAi/package.json</output>
    <output type="docs">.claude/adr/ADR-012-shared-components.md</output>
    <output type="test">tests/Spaarke.ArchTests/SharedPackageCensusTests.cs</output>
  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">The owner-approved action for ai-context is fully applied (package folder removed for consolidate/retire, or amendment present for sanction).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">SpaarkeAi builds and its existing tests pass.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">SharedPackageCensusTests passes; the census row and test entry match the new state.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: no reference to @spaarke/ai-context remains in src/ after a consolidate/retire (Grep returns 0).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Cover the moved behaviour's existing contract; anything beyond needs a one-line justification in notes.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>Item 4 PR(s) are separate from the items 1-3 PR (NFR-05). Completed 2026-11-13: types moved to ai-widgets src/types/aiContext.ts, package deleted, ADR-012 census + SharedPackageCensusTests updated; also fixed CI client-typecheck, deploy trigger, Build-AllClientComponents and master-deploy references. SpaarkeAi build + 1226 tests, ai-widgets tsc + 792 tests, ArchTests 2543 pass. Details: notes/031-ai-context.md.</notes>

  <execution>
    <skill>.claude/skills/task-execute/SKILL.md</skill>
    <protocol>Before starting, load all files listed in &lt;knowledge&gt;&lt;files&gt;. Follow task-execute for the pre-execution checklist.</protocol>
  </execution>
</task>
